@startuml
!include _style.iuml
autonumber
actor User
participant "Frontend\n(React)" as FE
participant "Backend\n(FastAPI)" as BE
database "Database\n(SQLite)" as DB
participant "ML Model\n(XGBoost)" as ML

== Login ==
User -> FE : enter email & password
FE -> BE : login request
BE -> DB : find user by email
DB --> BE : user record
BE -> BE : verify password hash
alt valid credentials
  BE --> FE : access token + user
  FE --> User : show prediction form
else invalid credentials
  BE --> FE : 401 error
  FE --> User : show error message
end

== Prediction ==
User -> FE : fill clinical data, click Predict
FE -> FE : validate fields
FE -> BE : prediction request (token, data)
BE -> ML : predict probability & contributions
ML --> BE : probability, SHAP values
BE -> BE : risk level + suggestions
BE -> DB : store health data & prediction
BE --> FE : prediction result
FE --> User : display result, factors, suggestions

== Report ==
User -> FE : click Download PDF Report
FE -> FE : generate PDF
FE --> User : PDF file download
@enduml
